将两数异或，结果中为 1 的位即两数不同的位，统计异或结果中 1 的个数即可。参考程序：

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    int n, m;
    cin >> n >> m;
    int x = n ^ m;
    int cnt = 0;
    while (x > 0) {
        cnt += x & 1;
        x >>= 1;
    }
    cout << cnt << endl;
    return 0;
}
```

四平方定理保证任意自然数可写成四个平方数之和。枚举 a ≤ b ≤ c，由 d² = n-a²-b²-c² 直接求 d 并验证 d ≥ c 且 d 为整数（d*d == rest）。三层循环上界经剪枝，n ≤ 50000 可过。参考程序：

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <cmath>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    int n;
    cin >> n;
    for (int a = 0; a * a <= n; a++) {
        for (int b = a; a * a + b * b <= n; b++) {
            for (int c = b; a * a + b * b + c * c <= n; c++) {
                int rest = n - a * a - b * b - c * c;
                int d = (int)sqrt(rest);
                if (d >= c && d * d == rest) {
                    cout << a << " " << b << " " << c << " " << d << endl;
                }
            }
        }
    }
    return 0;
}
```
